Package: mscc-ui
Version: 0.6.39
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Multus SDR / MSCC Linux <local@localhost>
Depends: libc6, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1, libxrandr2, libgl1 | libgl1-mesa-glx, ca-certificates
Recommends: mscc
Homepage: https://local/mscc
Description: MSCC UI (Avalonia) connect-only client for Multus / Proficio
 Graphical MSCC client for Raspberry Pi OS 64-bit (linux-arm64).
 Connects to ms-sdr already running (use MSCC Start); does not launch servers.
 Includes CQ keyer memory, Remote Audio (0x9B=2), and legacy external keyer.
 .
 Menu: MSCC UI (same MSCC menu as Start / Stop / Init).
 Installs under /opt/mscc-ui; launcher /usr/bin/mscc-ui.
 Client sticky settings: ~/.config/MSCC/mscc-avalonia.ini
